window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>F Is for Fear</i>, the sixth book in an epic series of 26 horror anthologies. In this audio, you will find a collection of 13 nightmarish tales from some of the most talented independent writers on the scene today. From spiders to snakes to things that dwell in the dark, <i>F Is for Fear</i> contains a variety of phobia-inducing stories that will set your heart racing.</p>"; 
